    "notes": "Three sessions, all in NYC (venue unspecified by jazzdisco). Jan 4: Gertrude's Bounce, Powell's Prances (also Junior's Arrival \u2014 bonus track not on original album). Feb 16: What Is This Thing Called Love?, Love Is a Many-Splendored Thing. Feb 17: I'll Remember April, Time, The Scene Is Clean (also Flossie Lou \u2014 bonus track). All personnel the same across all three sessions. Engineer not documented in available sources. This was Brown and Powell's final studio album \u2014 both died in a car accident June 1956."
